14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,290
These items are so premium, 
not even the highest-ranking nobles can get them!

15
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:40,380
What would Cid be doing with these?

16
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,560
No, wait!

17
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:47,280
Even rich dudes can't get these special tickets, right? 
If we show them to some girls...

18
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:51,000
Oh, the odds of our lady hunt succeeding 
will go through the roof!

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,600
We might even get somewhere 
with the glamorous girls of Mitsugoshi?

20
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:57,290
When you're dating a glamour girl, 
a high-end resort's just part of the package!

21
00:00:58,510 --> 00:00:59,630
How many are there?

22
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:01,600
Looks like six tickets.

23
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:04,630
Assuming three of them are for girls...

24
00:01:04,630 --> 00:01:06,120
One is for me.

25
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,250
Another one's for me.

26
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:09,200
What about the last one?

27
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,260
An extra one for me.

28
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:16,590
This is it!

29
00:01:17,380 --> 00:01:19,640
Excuse me, lovely lady!

30
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:22,150
We're going to a hot spring resort!

31
