Why?

494
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:41,100
How can you say such terrible things to me?

495
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:44,400
I'm trying... I'm trying...

496
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:48,790
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of you!

497
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,900
This magical energy...

498
00:18:55,310 --> 00:18:57,530
Ow, ow, ow! Uncle! Uncle! Uncle!

499
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:05,710
This is terrible!

500
00:19:05,710 --> 00:19:07,670
Escort the guests to safety! Quickly!

501
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:10,380
Is this what Shadow was trying to tell us?

502
00:19:10,380 --> 00:19:12,400
Come on, stop crying.

503
00:19:10,380 --> 00:19:13,550
Lady Alpha, it will damage the facility 
if we don't do something!

504
00:19:13,550 --> 00:19:15,290
We can't just stand here.

505
00:19:15,290 --> 00:19:16,510
Let's go, everyone!

506
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:17,470
Right!

507
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:23,310
Huh? These colors...

508
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:26,300
We can't let the public know 
we are Shadow Garden.

509
00:19:26,650 --> 00:19:28,610
Delta is going in first!

510
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:31,290
Me, too!

511
00:19:32,010 --> 00:19:33,500
We're all going in!

512
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:34,740
You can count on meâ

513
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:39,250
Continue the attack! Don't let up!

514
00:19:39,250 --> 00:19:42,310
Take that and that and that...

515
00:19:39,250 --> 00:19:40,110
It's not over yet!

516
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:42,500
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of you!

517
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:43,750
And that and that!

518
00:19:46,510 --> 00:19:50,170
Goodbye, o tragic dragon of antiquity.

519
00:20:01,210 --> 00:20:04,080
Golden tears, 
raining down from the heavens...

520
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,090
This is it!

521
00:20:05,090 --> 00:20:06,980
This is what our lord was looking for!

522
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:10,130
No doubt about it.

523
00:20:10,130 --> 00:20:12,940
The hot springs have been imbued 
with magical properties.

524
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:14,700
A new business opportunity!

525
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:17,150
They can now improve beauty, health,

526
00:20:17,530 --> 00:20:19,340
high blood pressure, constipation...

527
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,880
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of them.

528
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:20,250
Bust-enhancing properties?

529
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:22,770
It's always so hard to take first place.

530
00:20:20,250 --> 00:20:20,880
No.

531
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:21,880
Any bust-enhancing properties?

532
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,120
Face reality.

533
00:20:22,770 --> 00:20:23,120


534
00:20:32,410 --> 00:20:37,400
I'm sure Shadow wanted to rescue the soul 
of that kind and gentle dragon.

535
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:41,800
Now, are you ready to add 
the finishing touch?

536
00:20:42,670 --> 00:20:46,640
I hope you enjoyed our special event 
based on the Dragon's Tears Hot Spring!

537
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:50,350
Now, please feel welcome to purchase our new, 
limited edition, grand opening merchandise!

538
00:20:50,590 --> 00:20:54,000
For today only, we're offering 
a special discount if you buy the entire set!

539
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:56,900
Um, I took the day off...

540
00:20:56,900 --> 00:20:57,820
Take a comp day.

541
00:20:58,610 --> 00:20:59,950
Looks like everything worked out well.

542
00:20:59,950 --> 00:21:02,910
Yes! And the facility 
was only lightly damaged.

543
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:23,710
Thank you for the wonderful day off...

544
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:26,000
Shadow.

