3628
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:03,600
Y'know, I don't remember a single thing 
that happened all day.

3629
00:23:03,600 --> 00:23:06,820
What a coincidence, neither do I.

3630
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:10,600
But according to Count Virgin Boy,

3631
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:15,590
"Boys, to become a man means 
to be reborn," after all.

3632
00:23:15,590 --> 00:23:20,750
Uh, so you're saying, in exchange 
for becoming men, we lost our memories?

3633
00:23:20,750 --> 00:23:24,430
This is a giant leap for male virgins.

3634
00:23:24,430 --> 00:23:27,470
But for men, it's just the first small step.

3635
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,780
We won't be stopped!

3636
00:23:29,780 --> 00:23:32,070
No, we will keep going forward!

3637
00:23:32,420 --> 00:23:34,180
Our celibatory journey...

3638
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:36,110
starts now!

